{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-1727","published":"2026-03-27T11:10:45Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:42.790513737Z","upstream":["CVE-2025-11731"],"summary":"libxslt security update","details":"Libxslt is the XSLT C library developed for the GNOME project\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA flaw was found in the exsltFuncResultComp() function of libxslt, which handles EXSLT &lt;func:result&gt; elements during stylesheet parsing. Due to improper type handling, the function may treat an XML document node as a regular XML element node, resulting in a type confusion. This can cause unexpected memory reads and potential crashes. While difficult to exploit, the flaw could lead to application instability or denial of service.(CVE-2025-11731)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libxslt","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP1","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/libxslt&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["libxslt-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","libxslt-debuginfo-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","libxslt-debugsource-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","libxslt-devel-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","python3-libxslt-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["libxslt-help-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm"],"src":["libxslt-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["libxslt-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","libxslt-debuginfo-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","libxslt-debugsource-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","libxslt-devel-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","python3-libxslt-1.1.39-7.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-1727.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.openeuler.org/zh/security/security-bulletins/detail/?id=openEuler-SA-2026-1727"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-11731"}],"database_specific":{"severity":"Low"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":